  "body": "The authenticated image's installed SDK has 39 strong C++ string-ABI symbol misses. This adds a bounded image-bound loader-metadata auditor and a fresh controlled ABI0 replacement SDK; all 39 root misses disappear against exactly the same 21 authenticated provider payloads. The current image still contains the old SDK, and the replacement is retained as nonexecutable DATA for a later new-image handoff.\n\nAvailability is explicitly static and scoped to the SDK root. Three weak imports and 105 conservative transitive version-library diagnostics remain recorded; actual loader aliases, object ABI, runtime mapping, installation and scientific/native qualification remain blocked. No actual SDK/Panda/GL/MetaDrive/model/officialORT/loader execution, container starts, registry/Cloud publication, main/shared-base updates or consumed image request replay.\n\nValidation: actual 100-command/4,587-input compile-link closure; 33 APIs/one state/original-read static checks; actual ABI0 preprocessing preserves 270 lookups/18 routed/252 safe/cap256; 25 focused tests; complete 1,612 tests (1,605 pass/7 skipped). Sole fresh wholebranch review found two Important false-acceptance cases (COPY relocations and same-layer ancestor conflicts); both fixed in one RED\u2192GREEN pass, followed by fresh actual audits and the complete suite. No rereview or deferred fresh-review minors. Preserves 5,950 base files, 299 old pins, 10 originals, main, Drafts102\u2013115 and prior native/image histories. Native allowance0/strict0of4FAIL/Stage7INCOMPLETE.\n\nReview: docs/STAGE7_PANDA_SDK_LINK_RESULT.md, docs/STAGE7_PANDA_SDK_LINK_LEDGER.md and docs/evidence/panda-sdk-link-audit-01/selection.json. Exact final HEAD CI/body/API preservation receipt stays under output/stage7-panda-sdk-link-audit-01/final-verification.json.\n",
